(documentation InspirationEmotion EnglishWrittenLanguage "The &%InspirationEmotion is a specific kind of &%EmotionalState characterized by a feeling of being mentally stimulated to do or feel something, especially something creative.")
(instance InspirationEmotion EmotionalState)
